## 🧩 Phase 2 — Build Layer Wrappers

Create thin wrappers:

```php
ensure_calendar_week($pdo, $projectionId, $index)
ensure_calendar_day($pdo, $projectionId, $weekId, $index)
ensure_calendar_time($pdo, $projectionId, $dayId, $index)
ensure_calendar_event($pdo, $projectionId, $timeId, $index)
```

Each calls:

```php
ensure_calendar_node(...)
```

No independent logic allowed.

---

## 🔗 Phase 3 — Build Ensure Chain

### Address-based resolution:

```php
ensure_calendar_event_by_address($pdo, $projectionId, [3,1,2,1])
```

Executes:

```php
week  = ensure(..., WEEK,  null, 3)
day   = ensure(..., DAY,   week.id, 1)
time  = ensure(..., TIME,  day.id, 2)
event = ensure(..., EVENT, time.id, 1)
```

---

### Rule

```text
No skipping levels
No partial hierarchy creation
```

