## 🚫 Anti-Patterns (Strictly Forbidden)

```text
❌ "check then insert" without retry
❌ constructing chronology_address during writes
❌ skipping hierarchy levels
❌ computing sequence_index in memory only
❌ direct INSERT outside ensure path
❌ mixing legacy identity with structural identity
```

---

## 🧠 Final Mental Model

```text
DB:
  Defines what is allowed (constraints)

API:
  Defines how to safely reach that state

ensure_node:
  The ONLY write primitive
```

